<!-- SECTION: roadmap.Roadmap — title -->
<div class="titleband" data-screen-label="Roadmap — title"><h1>The <span class="u-1">Roadmap</span></h1></div>
<div class="u-46 introband">
  <h2>The road ahead, one milestone at a time.</h2>
  <p>Dates are targets. Evidence sets the pace. The stage order and the gates that protect each step do not move — the calendar does, as capacity and evidence change.</p>
</div>

<!-- SECTION: roadmap.Year one -->
<section data-screen-label="Year one">
  <div class="phase"><div><div class="when">First 90 days</div><span class="tgt">Target · 100–250 subscribers</span></div><ul>
    <li><b>Public launch</b> of the movement, the site, and the source library.</li>
    <li><b>Fiscal-sponsor application</b> and due diligence begins.</li>
    <li>The Pledge and email capture open; first sourced cost visual published.</li>
    <li>Core policies released as public review drafts.</li>
    <li>Tax-deductible donations open <b>only</b> after sponsorship is confirmed.</li>
  </ul></div>
  <div class="phase"><div><div class="when">Months 4–6</div><span class="tgt">Target · 2–3 regions</span></div><ul>
    <li>First <b>Human Essentials Dashboard</b> prototype.</li>
    <li>Regional methodology published.</li>
    <li>Initial <b>Shelter, Food, and Energy</b> dossiers.</li>
  </ul></div>
  <div class="phase"><div><div class="when">Months 7–9</div><span class="tgt">Target · 15–35 active members</span></div><ul>
    <li>Project briefs and first creator partnerships.</li>
    <li>First community survey through the advisory Assembly.</li>
    <li>Early Treasury updates once funds move.</li>
  </ul></div>
  <div class="phase"><div><div class="when">Months 10–12</div><span class="tgt">Target · 2–5 creator partners</span></div><ul>
    <li>Public progress report and partner outreach.</li>
    <li>Funding applications and a Year 2 plan.</li>
  </ul></div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION: roadmap.Longer horizon -->
<section class="blk blk--ink u-block--ink" data-screen-label="Longer horizon">
  <div class="u-5 eyebrow">The longer horizon</div>
  <h2 class="u-6 sec">Only when the evidence and safety are <span class="u-1">ready</span>.</h2>
  <div class="gates">
    <div><h3><i></i>Year 2</h3><p>More regions and sectors, the Community Resource Simulator and Library of Things Kit, a wider contributor network, and grant applications.</p></div>
    <div><h3><i></i>Year 3</h3><p>Partner-led, low-risk physical prototypes where funding, safety review, legal capacity, and local operators exist.</p></div>
    <div><h3><i></i>Beyond</h3><p>Larger integrated demonstrations — only once evidence, partners, governance, and safety capacity are mature.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION: roadmap.Disclaimer -->
<section class="blk blk--wheat" data-screen-label="Disclaimer">
  {#- V25: a standard prose band. The eyebrow slot stays empty until approved
