  <h2 class="sec">How to read these dates</h2>
  <p class="u-137 lead">Every date on this page is a movable target anchored to Day 1, not a promise. Targets shift as evidence and capacity change; the order of the stages and the gates that protect each one — funding, safety review, legal capacity, and local operators — do not.</p>
</section>

